st the official Intervals.icu API docs or a live download before relying on it."],"durationSeconds":6.397290083,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019xe79aXFL5jwWcojPwqnp8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
