{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xa245DH9Ga9xqN8ibsE7dY","type":"tool_result","content":"diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex 31b0941..be8ac10 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -9,8 +9,9 @@ exports them to the athlete's Garmin watch through Garmin Connect.\n - `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and\n   notes on what the watch displayed.\n \n-Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\n-in plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n+Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). Plans give HR targets as\n+percentages of `lthr` (set in each plan); `gen.py` resolves them to absolute bpm\n+before sending, because %LTHR targets come out as the watch's zone bands.\n \n ```\n python3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c2bea3dd-9e3e-4f96-bf4b-b795559c0a32","uuid":"84935c26-26db-4b47-8f37-b2edcb181b6e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:25:35.898Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"diff --git a/README.md b/README.md\nindex 31b0941..be8ac10 100644\n--- a/README.md\n+++ b/README.md\n@@ -9,8 +9,9 @@ exports them to the athlete's Garmin watch through Garmin Connect.\n - `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and\n   notes on what the watch displayed.\n \n-Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\n-in plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n+Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). Plans give HR targets as\n+percentages of `lthr` (set in each plan); `gen.py` resolves them to absolute bpm\n+before sending, because %LTHR targets come out as the watch's zone bands.\n \n ```\n python3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Xa245DH9